 <umutcagand@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:58:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gms: drop the Pixel Instant Hotspot service (local)

SystemUI binds com.google.android.gms magictether on boot, gets
"Service without Chimera impl" and crashes in setup on m20lte.
---
 .../overlay/GoogleConfigOverlay_GMS/res/values/config.xml       | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/common/proprietary/product/overlay/GoogleConfigOverlay_GMS/res/values/config.xml b/common/proprietary/product/overlay/GoogleConfigOverlay_GMS/res/values/config.xml
index 82c43a2..b95ce40 100644
--- a/common/proprietary/product/overlay/GoogleConfigOverlay_GMS/res/values/config.xml
+++ b/common/proprietary/product/overlay/GoogleConfigOverlay_GMS/res/values/config.xml
@@ -156,10 +156,8 @@
     </string-array>
 
     <!-- Package name of the system service that implements the shared connectivity service -->
-    <string name="config_sharedConnectivityServicePackage" translatable="false">com.google.android.gms</string>
 
     <!-- Intent action used when binding to the shared connectivity service -->
-    <string name="config_sharedConnectivityServiceIntentAction" translatable="false">com.google.android.gms.magictether.BIND</string>
 
     <!-- The system and settings UI can support all the features of instant tether. If set to false,
      instant tether will run in notifications mode -->
-- 
2.43.0

